t branch.\"\n30\t   :upstream-revision \"86fca0d1d054af005cb37395eae04500d45e6279\"}\n31\t  :compile-malformed\n32\t  {:call (latte-kernel.proof/compile-proof (quote [42]))\n33\t   :boundary :upstream-malformed-proof-sequence\n34\t   :reason \"Scalar proof step raises a native sequence exception upstream and a portable sequence refusal in C; no agreement is claimed.\"\n35\t   :upstream-revision \"86fca0d1d054af005cb37395eae04500d45e6279\"}}}"}
